{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0305","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000011d:text","row":39839,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"みみ先輩は眠っておられた。","en":"Mimi was fast asleep.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904549","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00001","en":"Mimi-senpai was yet still sleeping.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000157:text","row":39840,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「もしもしー」","en":"“Hellooo?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904550","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Hello, hellooo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000215:text","row":39841,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「……んー？」","en":"“……Hmm?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904551","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00003","en":"Misato: \"...mmmh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000243:text","row":39842,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはようございます。朝です。太一です」","en":"“Good morning. It's morning. Taichi here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904552","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Good day to you. It is morning. I am Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000002a8:text","row":39843,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「え……あ、本当……」","en":"“Huh… Oh, it really is…”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904553","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00005","en":"Misato: \"Eh... ah, it's true...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000002d6:text","row":39844,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"のろのろと起きあがる。","en":"She slowly sat up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904554","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00006","en":"Slowly and sluggishly she gets up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000304:text","row":39845,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"えーと、パンツ見られるんだよな。","en":"Right. This was where I got to see her panties.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904555","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00007","en":"Uhmmm, I will be seeing her panties, right.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000033c:text","row":39846,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は片膝をついた。","en":"I went down on one knee.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904556","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00008","en":"I went to one knee,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000366:text","row":39847,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"女王に使える騎士のごとくだ（動機はともかく）。","en":"Like a knight in service to his queen—never mind the motive.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904557","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00009","en":"the same as a knight who wishes to be of use to his Queen (except for the motivation).","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The simile is of a knight serving or attending his queen. The English reduces the formal relationship to a wish to be useful.","remedy":"a knight serving his queen","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":12,"text":"a knight who wishes to be of use to his Queen"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000432:text","row":39848,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「とりあえず、おはようございます」","en":"“Anyway, good morning.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904558","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00010","en":"Misato: \"First thing, good morning!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000474:text","row":39849,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはようございます、先輩」","en":"“Good morning, Misato.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904559","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Good morning, Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000004b0:text","row":39850,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「日中にここで寝こけると陽光で死にますよ？」","en":"“If you sleep up here during the day, the sunlight will kill you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904560","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00012","en":"Taichi: \"If you sleep here in the middle of the day you will die of sunlight exposure, you know?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000519:text","row":39851,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、はい、そうですね、気をつけました」","en":"“Ah. Yes, that’s true. I was careful.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904561","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00013","en":"Misato: \"Ah, yes, that is right, I was careful.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Misato acknowledges the warning and says she will be careful from now on. The English shifts the caution into a completed past action.","remedy":"I'll be careful.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":33,"text":"I was careful."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000559:text","row":39852,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"スカートの裾を持ち上げて眼鏡をふく。","en":"She lifted the hem of her skirt to wipe her glasses.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904562","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00014","en":"Senpai lifts the hem of her skirt and wipes her glasses.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000595:text","row":39853,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"おー。","en":"Ohhh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904563","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00015","en":"Ohhh,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000005b3:text","row":39854,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"むちむちしてる。","en":"So soft and curvy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904564","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00016","en":"plump and voluptuous.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000005db:text","row":39855,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"ほどよくむちむちしてる。","en":"Just the right amount of soft and curvy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904565","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00017","en":"So moderately plump and voluptuous.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000060b:text","row":39856,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩はきれいだなぁ。","en":"Misato really is beautiful.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904566","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00018","en":"Senpai's so pretty ain't she.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000006bd:text","row":39857,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふぁぁぁ」","en":"“Yaaaaawn.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904567","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00019","en":"Misato: \"Fwhaaah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000006e1:text","row":39858,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"スカートがぱさりと元に戻った。","en":"Her skirt fluttered back into place.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904568","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00020","en":"The skirt returned to its original position with a paf,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000717:text","row":39859,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は眼鏡をかけ直す。","en":"Misato put her glasses on again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904569","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00021","en":"and Senpai wears back her glasses.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The phrasal action is 'puts her glasses back on'; 'wears back' is not grammatical English.","remedy":"puts her glasses back on","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":11,"text":"wears back her glasses"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000007cb:text","row":39860,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「眠いですね」","en":"“I'm sleepy.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904570","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00022","en":"Misato: \"I am so sleepy.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000007f9:text","row":39861,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「小夏日和ですものね」","en":"“It's little-summer weather, after all.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904571","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00023","en":"Taichi: \"It is just the Indian Spring.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000008ad:text","row":39862,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「聞いたことがない言葉です……」","en":"“I've never heard that expression...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904572","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00024","en":"Misato: \"I have not heard the words exactly like that...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000008ed:text","row":39863,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「作りましたから」","en":"“I made it up.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904573","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00025","en":"Taichi: \"Because I invented them.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000099d:text","row":39864,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんはものを作る才能があるようです」","en":"“X seems to have a talent for making things.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904574","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00026","en":"Misato: \"Peke-kun, you seem to have a talent for inventing things.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000009e7:text","row":39865,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904575","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00027","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000a2c:text","row":39866,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしてしゃがんだままなんですか？」","en":"“Why are you still crouching down?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904576","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00028","en":"Misato: \"Why are you staying squatted like that?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000a72:text","row":39867,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「愛の高射砲が空に恋しているのです。へそまで反り返らんばかりに」","en":"“Love's antiaircraft gun yearns for the sky. It threatens to arch all the way back to my navel.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904577","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00029","en":"Taichi: \"My Anti-Aircraft Gun of Love has fallen madly in lust for this sky. It has recurved 'till nearly it reaches the belly button.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000aef:text","row":39868,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「無骨ではありますが、それでいて詩的な物言い……」","en":"“Rough-hewn, yet poetic phrasing…”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904578","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00030","en":"Misato: \"That is something so uncouth, and yet you speak of it in ways so poetic...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000b41:text","row":39869,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「恐縮です」","en":"“You flatter me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904579","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00031","en":"Taichi: \"I am sorry for the trouble I am causing.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"Taichi's 恐縮です is a polite, comic acknowledgment meaning he is honored or obliged by the praise, not an apology for causing trouble.","remedy":"I'm honored.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":49,"start":9,"text":"I am sorry for the trouble I am causing."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000beb:text","row":39870,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「のどかわきましたね」","en":"“I'm thirsty.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904580","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00032","en":"Misato: \"Say, I am a bit parched.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000cd1:text","row":39871,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は自分の荷物をあさった。","en":"Misato rummaged through her things.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904581","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00033","en":"Senpai rustled into her own bags.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","grammar"],"assessment":"She rummages through her belongings. 'Rustled into' describes neither searching nor a grammatical movement into bags.","remedy":"rummaged through her bag","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":32,"start":7,"text":"rustled into her own bags"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000d05:text","row":39872,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"ころん","en":"Clunk.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904582","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00034","en":"Tumble!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000d2b:text","row":39873,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904583","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00035","en":"Taichi: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000d4b:text","row":39874,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"ワンカップの酒瓶だ。","en":"It was a single-serving bottle of sake.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904584","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00036","en":"A single serving of cup sake.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese identifies a one-cup sake bottle or jar. The English describes a serving but omits the physical container that tumbles out.","remedy":"A one-cup sake bottle.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":0,"text":"A single serving of cup sake."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000d9c:text","row":39875,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「ごくごくごくごく」","en":"“Glug, glug, glug, glug.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904585","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00037","en":"Misato: \"Gulp, gulp, gulp, gulp!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000dd0:text","row":39876,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「おわ、そうだった！」","en":"“Whoa, that's right!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904586","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00038","en":"Taichi: \"Bwah, I nearly forgot!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000dfe:text","row":39877,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"奪い取る。","en":"I snatched it away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904587","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00039","en":"I forcibly take it away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000ea6:text","row":39878,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ……なにするですか」","en":"“Ah… what are you doing?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904588","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00040","en":"Misato: \"Ah...! What are doing?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The question omits its subject pronoun.","remedy":"What are you doing?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":16,"text":"What are doing?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000ee0:text","row":39879,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「学校でお酒はダメ！」","en":"“No drinking at school!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904589","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Alcoholics are not allowed at school!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wrong_subject"],"assessment":"Taichi says drinking alcohol at school is forbidden. The English instead bans people with alcoholism from entering school.","remedy":"No alcohol at school!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":46,"start":9,"text":"Alcoholics are not allowed at school!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000f94:text","row":39880,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「おばあちゃんの家が酒屋さんなので、いいのです」","en":"“My grandmother runs a liquor store, so it's allowed.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904590","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00042","en":"Misato: \"My grandma's house is also a liquor store, so it is fine.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00000fe4:text","row":39881,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「だめですよ」","en":"“No, it isn't.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904591","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00043","en":"Taichi: \"It is not allowed!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001090:text","row":39882,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「……知ってます」","en":"“…I know.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904592","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00044","en":"Misato: \"...I do know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000010ba:text","row":39883,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"拗ねた。","en":"She sulked.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904593","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00045","en":"She pouted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000010ff:text","row":39884,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも、もう守る決まりごともないじゃないですか」","en":"“But there aren't any rules left to follow, are there?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904594","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00046","en":"Misato: \"But by now there are no more rules we must follow, are there?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000114f:text","row":39885,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Well.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904595","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00047","en":"Taichi: \"Well.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000011f5:text","row":39886,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうなんですよね、人がいなかったら、ルールなんて意味がないんです」","en":"“That's the thing, isn't it? Without people, rules don't mean anything.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904596","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00048","en":"Misato: \"It is just like that, yes, when people are not there anymore, then rules have no meaning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001276:text","row":39887,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあわたしは、なんのために……」","en":"“Then what am I for...?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904597","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00049","en":"Misato: \"Then, for what purpose should I...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000012b2:text","row":39888,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"頭をかきむしる。","en":"She tore at her hair.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904598","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00050","en":"She nearly tears the hair off her head.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000012e2:text","row":39889,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「……先輩」","en":"“…Misato.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904599","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00051","en":"Taichi: \"...Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000138c:text","row":39890,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんは、どうしてここに？」","en":"“X, why did you come here?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904600","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00052","en":"Misato: \"Peke-kun, why are you here?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000013cc:text","row":39891,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「様子を見に来たんです」","en":"“I came to see how you were doing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904601","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00053","en":"Taichi: \"I came to see how things are.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001482:text","row":39892,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうして……今さら」","en":"“…Why… now, after all this time?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904602","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00054","en":"Misato: \"...why... after all this time.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000014bc:text","row":39893,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「みみ先輩が、好きだから」","en":"“Because I love you, Mimi.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904603","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00055","en":"Taichi: \"Because I love you, Mimi-senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001513:text","row":39894,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………そんな……ことを……」","en":"“…………To say… such a thing…”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904604","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00056","en":"Misato: \"......that... is just...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000154b:text","row":39895,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"鼻の頭が赤いのは、酒のせいだろうか？","en":"Was the tip of her nose red from the alcohol?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904605","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00057","en":"The tip of her nose reddening should be alcohol's fault, right?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000160d:text","row":39896,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「軽々しく言ってはいけません！　愛の言葉は、男女双方にとって大切な分岐点になるんですから！」","en":"“You mustn't say that so lightly! Words of love mark an important turning point for both the man and the woman!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904606","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00058","en":"Misato: \"Speaking this frivolously is unacceptable! Words of love are what creates a precious crossroad between men and women both!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001681:text","row":39897,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"叱られた。","en":"She scolded me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904607","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00059","en":"I was scolded.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000016ab:text","row":39898,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや……でも、俺を暗がりから明るい場所に導いてくれたの、先輩っすから」","en":"“No… but you're the one who led me out of the dark and into the light, Misato.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904608","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00060","en":"Taichi: \"Well... but the one who led me out of the darkness and into a place of light was you, Senpai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000170b:text","row":39899,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"ただ隣にいるだけだった彼女とは違う。","en":"Not like her, who had only ever stood beside me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904609","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00061","en":"Unlike a certain she who merely lived next to me and nothing more.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The comparison is with a woman who merely stayed by his side without guiding him. 'Lived next to me' changes emotional proximity into neighboring residences.","remedy":"her, who only ever stayed beside me","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":48,"start":7,"text":"a certain she who merely lived next to me"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000017cd:text","row":39900,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなこと……ただ声をかけただけですから」","en":"“I didn't do anything like that… I only spoke to you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904610","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00062","en":"Misato: \"That would be... I just called out to you, that is all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001819:text","row":39901,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「きっかけってそんなものでしょう？」","en":"“Isn't that how things begin?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904611","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00063","en":"Taichi: \"And what was the cue but that?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","grammar"],"assessment":"Taichi says a catalyst or beginning is often something that small. The English forms an archaic rhetorical question about a 'cue' and does not convey the general point.","remedy":"That's all a catalyst ever is, right?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":39,"start":9,"text":"And what was the cue but that?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:000018db:text","row":39902,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「はいっ、はいっ、このお話はなしでーす」","en":"“All right, all right! That's enough of this conversation.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904612","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00064","en":"Misato: \"Enough! Enough! We move on from this topic nooow!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:0000191b:text","row":39903,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"ぱたぱたと手を振る。","en":"She flapped one hand dismissively.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904613","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00065","en":"Flapping wave of the hand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001947:text","row":39904,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"……駄目か。","en":"…No good, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904614","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00066","en":"...is this not going to work?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001973:text","row":39905,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「結婚を前提としたおつきあいを―――」","en":"“Would you go out with me, with marriage in mind—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904615","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00067","en":"Taichi: \"Association, such as dating, as a prerequisite for marriage is---\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi proposes dating with marriage as the understood goal. The English instead makes dating a prerequisite for marriage and leaves the proposal without a finite verb.","remedy":"Would you date me with marriage in mind—","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":74,"start":9,"text":"Association, such as dating, as a prerequisite for marriage is---"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001a37:text","row":39906,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうだ、原稿お願いシマス！」","en":"“Oh, right! Please write the script!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904616","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00068","en":"Misato: \"Right, a script if-you-please!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001a6d:text","row":39907,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"逃げた。","en":"She dodged it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904617","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00069","en":"She ran away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001a95:text","row":39908,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「原稿ですか？」","en":"“A script?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904618","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00070","en":"Taichi: \"A script, you say?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001b43:text","row":39909,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、清く正しく明るく元気な、初回放送用の原稿作成依頼です」","en":"“Yes. I'd like you to write a pure, proper, cheerful, energetic script for our first broadcast.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904619","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00071","en":"Misato: \"Yes, this is a request for the production of a pure, honest, cheerful and spirited script for use in our maiden broadcast.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001ba1:text","row":39910,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「……んー」","en":"“...Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904620","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00072","en":"Taichi: \"...hmmm.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001bc5:text","row":39911,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"まあ、当初の目的だな。","en":"Well, that was why I'd come in the first place.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904621","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00073","en":"Well, that was the objective from the beginning, after all.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001bfb:text","row":39912,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいですよ」","en":"“All right.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904622","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00074","en":"Taichi: \"It will be done.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001cbc:text","row":39913,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"どうせノートに、今までのパターンも網羅されてる。","en":"My notebook already covered every pattern we'd used so far anyway.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904623","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00075","en":"However it goes, all patterns up to now have been encompassed in the notebook.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0305:00001d04:text","row":39914,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"わざわざ新しく作る必要もない。","en":"There was no need to make anything new from scratch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904624","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014b:00076","en":"There's no necessity to purposefully create a new one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
